---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Alex Donuts · Caso de estudio · Duarte.Dev"
	description="Caso de estudio de Alex Donuts: sitio web para negocio gastronómico desarrollado por Duarte.Dev."
>
	<Navbar />
	<main class="case">
		<header class="case__hero">
			<div class="case__hero-inner">
				<div class="case__hero-content">
					<div class="case__hero-top">
						<p class="case__eyebrow">PROYECTO · 01</p>
						<a class="case__back-inline" href="/#proyectos">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
								<path
									d="M13 8H3M3 8L7.5 3.5M3 8L7.5 12.5"
									stroke="currentColor"
									stroke-width="1.4"
									stroke-linecap="round"
									stroke-linejoin="round"
								/>
							</svg>
							Volver a proyectos
						</a>
					</div>
					<h1 class="case__title">Alex Donuts</h1>
					<p class="case__category">Web para negocio gastronómico</p>
					<p class="case__lead">
						Sitio web desarrollado para presentar los productos, información y contenido de Alex Donuts, con
						herramientas para que el negocio pueda administrar su propia web.
					</p>
					<div class="case__actions">
						<a
							class="case__button case__button--primary"
							href="https://alexdonuts.vercel.app"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Visitar sitio
							<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
								<path
									d="M4.5 11.5L11.5 4.5M11.5 4.5H6M11.5 4.5V10"
									stroke="currentColor"
									stroke-width="1.4"
									stroke-linecap="round"
									stroke-linejoin="round"
								/>
							</svg>
						</a>
						<a class="case__button case__button--ghost" href="/#proyectos">Volver a proyectos</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="case__hero-media">
					<span class="case__hero-media-label">Vista móvil</span>
					<div class="case__device">
						<img
							class="case__device-image"
							src="/images/proyectos/ADM.jpg"
							alt="Vista móvil del sitio web de Alex Donuts"
							width="1536"
							height="1024"
							loading="eager"
							decoding="async"
						/>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<section class="case__section" aria-labelledby="objective-title">
			<div class="case__section-inner">
				<header class="case__section-header">
					<div class="case__section-header-top">
						<p class="case__eyebrow">EL OBJETIVO</p>
						<span class="case__section-count">01</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="case__section-title" id="objective-title">Una web pensada para el negocio y sus clientes.</h2>
					<p class="case__section-text">
						El objetivo fue crear un sitio donde Alex Donuts pudiera mostrar sus productos, precios, información
						del local y contenido de forma clara, con especial atención a la experiencia desde celular.
					</p>
					<p class="case__section-text">
						El diseño y las funcionalidades fueron desarrollados de acuerdo con las necesidades y solicitudes del
						negocio, buscando una solución práctica, directa y fiel a lo que se requería.
					</p>
				</header>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="case__section" aria-labelledby="build-title">
			<div class="case__section-inner">
				<header class="case__section-header">
					<div class="case__section-header-top">
						<p class="case__eyebrow">LO QUE DESARROLLÉ</p>
						<span class="case__section-count">02</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="case__section-title" id="build-title">Estructura clara, pensada para administrar el contenido.</h2>
				</header>

				<ol class="case__list">
					<li class="case__item">
						<span class="case__item-number">01 —</span>
						<h3 class="case__item-title">Catálogo de productos</h3>
						<p class="case__item-text">Productos organizados por categorías, con precios, descripciones y disponibilidad.</p>
					</li>
					<li class="case__item">
						<span class="case__item-number">02 —</span>
						<h3 class="case__item-title">Panel administrativo</h3>
						<p class="case__item-text">Herramientas para gestionar contenido del sitio sin necesidad de modificar directamente el código.</p>
					</li>
					<li class="case__item">
						<span class="case__item-number">03 —</span>
						<h3 class="case__item-title">Galería</h3>
						<p class="case__item-text">Espacio para mostrar fotografías y contenido visual del negocio.</p>
					</li>
					<li class="case__item">
						<span class="case__item-number">04 —</span>
						<h3 class="case__item-title">Información del local</h3>
						<p class="case__item-text">Horarios, ubicación, contacto e información relevante para los clientes.</p>
					</li>
					<li class="case__item">
						<span class="case__item-number">05 —</span>
						<h3 class="case__item-title">Diseño responsive</h3>
						<p class="case__item-text">Interfaz adaptada para funcionar correctamente en celular, tablet y escritorio.</p>
					</li>
				</ol>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="case__section" aria-labelledby="tech-title">
			<div class="case__section-inner">
				<header class="case__section-header">
					<div class="case__section-header-top">
						<p class="case__eyebrow">TECNOLOGÍAS</p>
						<span class="case__section-count">03</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="case__section-title" id="tech-title">Tecnologías utilizadas</h2>
					<p class="case__section-text">
						El proyecto combina una interfaz rápida con herramientas para gestionar contenido dinámico y publicar
						cambios de forma sencilla.
					</p>
				</header>
				<ul class="case__tech-list">
					<li class="case__tech-item">Astro</li>
					<li class="case__tech-item">React</li>
					<li class="case__tech-item">Supabase</li>
					<li class="case__tech-item">Vercel</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="case__section" aria-labelledby="result-title">
			<div class="case__section-inner">
				<header class="case__section-header">
					<div class="case__section-header-top">
						<p class="case__eyebrow">RESULTADO</p>
						<span class="case__section-count">04</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="case__section-title" id="result-title">Una experiencia pensada también para móvil.</h2>
				</header>
				<div class="case__carousel" data-result-carousel data-autoplay="true" data-interval="4500">
					<div class="case__carousel-inner">
						<div class="case__carousel-viewport" data-carousel-viewport tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Galería de capturas del proyecto Alex Donuts">
							<ul class="case__carousel-track">
								<li class="case__slide" data-slide>
									<figure class="case__slide-figure">
										<img
											class="case__slide-image"
											src="/images/proyectos/ADM.jpg"
											alt="Captura de Alex Donuts mostrando la experiencia móvil"
											width="1536"
											height="1024"
											loading="lazy"
											decoding="async"
										/>
										<figcaption class="case__slide-caption">Vista móvil</figcaption>
									</figure>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div class="case__carousel-controls">
							<button class="case__carousel-btn" type="button" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Captura anterior" disabled>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
									<path d="M13 8H3M3 8L7.5 3.5M3 8L7.5 12.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
								</svg>
							</button>
							<div class="case__carousel-meta">
								<span class="case__carousel-counter" data-carousel-counter aria-live="polite">01 / 01</span>
							</div>
							<button class="case__carousel-btn" type="button" data-carousel-next aria-label="Captura siguiente" disabled>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
									<path d="M3 8H13M13 8L8.5 3.5M13 8L8.5 12.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
								</svg>
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="case__cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
			<div class="case__cta-inner">
				<div class="case__cta-copy">
					<p class="case__eyebrow">SIGUIENTE PASO</p>
					<h2 class="case__cta-title" id="cta-title">¿Querés algo así para tu negocio?</h2>
					<p class="case__cta-text">
						Podemos crear una web adaptada a lo que necesitás, desde una página informativa hasta catálogos, reservas
						o herramientas para administrar tu contenido.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="case__cta-actions">
					<a class="case__button case__button--primary" href="/#contacto">
						Hablemos de tu proyecto
						<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
							<path
								d="M3 8H13M13 8L8.5 3.5M13 8L8.5 12.5"
								stroke="currentColor"
								stroke-width="1.4"
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
							/>
						</svg>
					</a>
					<a class="case__button case__button--ghost" href="/#proyectos">Ver más proyectos</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
	<script is:inline>
		(() => {
			const carousel = document.querySelector("[data-result-carousel]");
			if (!carousel) return;
			const viewport = carousel.querySelector("[data-carousel-viewport]");
			const track = carousel.querySelector(".case__carousel-track");
			const slides = Array.from(carousel.querySelectorAll("[data-slide]"));
			const prev = carousel.querySelector("[data-carousel-prev]");
			const next = carousel.querySelector("[data-carousel-next]");
			const counter = carousel.querySelector("[data-carousel-counter]");
			if (!viewport || !track || slides.length === 0) return;

			const pad = (v) => String(v).padStart(2, "0");
			const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)");
			let index = 0;
			let timer = null;
			const interval = Number(carousel.getAttribute("data-interval") || 4500);

			const update = () => {
				const slide = slides[index];
				if (!slide) return;
				viewport.scrollTo({ left: slide.offsetLeft, behavior: reduceMotion.matches ? "auto" : "smooth" });
				if (counter) counter.textContent = `${pad(index + 1)} / ${pad(slides.length)}`;
				if (prev) prev.disabled = index === 0;
				if (next) next.disabled = index === slides.length - 1;
			};

			const go = (i) => {
				if (slides.length <= 1) return;
				index = (i + slides.length) % slides.length;
				update();
			};

			const stop = () => {
				if (timer) {
					clearInterval(timer);
					timer = null;
				}
			};

			const start = () => {
				if (slides.length <= 1 || reduceMotion.matches) return;
				stop();
				timer = setInterval(() => go(index + 1), interval);
			};

			prev?.addEventListener("click", () => {
				stop();
				go(index - 1);
				start();
			});
			next?.addEventListener("click", () => {
				stop();
				go(index + 1);
				start();
			});

			viewport.addEventListener("mouseenter", stop);
			viewport.addEventListener("mouseleave", start);
			viewport.addEventListener("focusin", stop);
			viewport.addEventListener("focusout", start);

			let down = null;
			viewport.addEventListener("pointerdown", (e) => {
				if (slides.length <= 1) return;
				down = { x: e.clientX, scroll: viewport.scrollLeft };
				stop();
			});
			viewport.addEventListener("pointerup", (e) => {
				if (!down || slides.length <= 1) return;
				const dx = e.clientX - down.x;
				if (Math.abs(dx) > 40) {
					if (dx > 0) go(index - 1);
					else go(index + 1);
				}
				down = null;
				start();
			});
			viewport.addEventListener("pointercancel", () => {
				down = null;
				start();
			});

			window.addEventListener("resize", update);
			update();
			if (slides.length > 1) start();
		})();
	</script>
</Layout>

<style>
	.case {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
	}

	.case__hero {
		position: relative;
		padding: 8rem 1.5rem 5rem;
	}

	.case__hero-inner {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
	}

	.case__hero-content {
		grid-column: 1 / span 7;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.1rem;
		animation: case-fade 0.7s ease both;
	}

	.case__hero-top {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.case__eyebrow {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.28em;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.case__back-inline {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.case__back-inline svg {
		width: 1rem;
		height: 1rem;
		transition: transform 0.25s ease;
	}

	.case__back-inline:hover,
	.case__back-inline:focus-visible {
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.case__back-inline:hover svg,
	.case__back-inline:focus-visible svg {
		transform: translateX(-3px);
	}

	.case__title {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5rem);
		line-height: 1.02;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.case__category {
		margin: -0.2rem 0 0;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.case__lead {
		margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
		max-width: 58ch;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.16rem);
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.case__actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		margin-top: 0.8rem;
	}

	.case__button {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 0.3rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease,
			box-shadow 0.25s ease;
	}

	.case__button svg {
		width: 1rem;
		height: 1rem;
		transition: transform 0.25s ease;
	}

	.case__button--primary {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue) 0%, var(--accent-violet) 100%);
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.case__button--primary:hover,
	.case__button--primary:focus-visible {
		transform: translateY(-1px);
		box-shadow: 0 18px 50px -28px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.95);
	}

	.case__button--primary:hover svg,
	.case__button--primary:focus-visible svg {
		transform: translate(2px, -2px);
	}

	.case__button--ghost {
		border-color: var(--border-color);
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.case__button--ghost:hover,
	.case__button--ghost:focus-visible {
		border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.7);
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1) 0%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.12) 100%);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.case__button:active {
		transform: translateY(0);
	}

	.case__hero-media {
		grid-column: 8 / span 5;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		animation: case-fade 0.7s ease 0.1s both;
	}

	.case__hero-media-label {
		align-self: flex-start;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.22em;
		opacity: 0.8;
		padding-left: 0.15rem;
	}

	.case__device {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 280px;
		padding: 6px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		border-radius: 1.75rem;
		background: var(--bg-secondary);
		box-shadow: 0 30px 70px -50px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.55);
	}

	.case__device::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 12px;
		left: 50%;
		width: 3rem;
		height: 3px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--bg-primary);
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.case__device-image {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 1.45rem;
		object-fit: contain;
		object-position: top;
	}

	.case__section {
		padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 0;
	}

	.case__section-inner {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2.8rem;
		padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.case__section-header {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
		max-width: 820px;
		animation: case-fade 0.7s ease both;
	}

	.case__section-header-top {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.case__section-count {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		opacity: 0.8;
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
		border-left: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
	}

	.case__section-title {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.case__section-text {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 68ch;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.case__list {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		animation: case-fade 0.7s ease 0.08s both;
	}

	.case__item {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 5.5rem minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
		align-items: start;
		padding: 1.9rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.case__item-number {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		padding-top: 0.25rem;
	}

	.case__item-title {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: -0.015em;
	}

	.case__item-text {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.case__tech-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		animation: case-fade 0.7s ease 0.08s both;
	}

	.case__tech-item {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.01em;
	}

	.case__carousel {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		animation: case-fade 0.7s ease 0.08s both;
	}

	.case__carousel-inner {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 880px;
	}

	.case__carousel-viewport {
		width: 100%;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		background: var(--bg-secondary);
	}

	.case__carousel-viewport:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid var(--accent-violet-light);
		outline-offset: 2px;
	}

	.case__carousel-track {
		display: flex;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.case__slide {
		flex: 0 0 100%;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.case__slide-figure {
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.7rem;
	}

	.case__slide-image {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		max-height: 72vh;
		object-fit: contain;
		background: var(--bg-primary);
	}

	.case__slide-caption {
		align-self: flex-start;
		padding: 0 0.4rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.case__carousel-controls {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.case__carousel-btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 2.4rem;
		height: 2.4rem;
		padding: 0;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
